# filepath: src/drone_bringup/config/px4/migration_from_ardupilot.params
# Values salvaged from the ArduPilot 4.5.4 dump (docs/ardupilot_4.5.4_params_
# pre_reflash.txt) for the PX4 v1.15 reflash. Apply via QGC AFTER the
# airframe preset and sensor calibration, alongside gate3_ekf2.params.
# Same physical hardware, so these transfer; each carries its AP source.

# ---- Optical flow (HereFlow) mounting — resolves two [MEASURE] items ----
SENS_FLOW_ROT     0        # AP FLOW_ORIENT_YAW=0 (mounting unchanged)
EKF2_OF_POS_X     0.07     # AP FLOW_POS_X [VERIFY convention: AP is IMU-
EKF2_OF_POS_Y     0.05     # relative FRD; PX4 same. Sanity-check signs on
EKF2_OF_POS_Z     0.11     # the airframe before Gate 4.]

# ---- Power module calibration (same PM, values transfer) ----
BAT1_V_DIV        18.18    # AP BATT_VOLT_MULT
BAT1_A_PER_V      36.36    # AP BATT_AMP_PERVLT
BAT1_N_CELLS      6        # AP low/crit voltages (21.2/20.4 V) imply 6S

# ---- Hover throttle starting point (X500 flight-proven on AP) ----
MPC_THR_HOVER     0.62     # AP MOT_THST_HOVER learned value 0.6209

# ---- Downward rangefinder: Benewake serial (AP RNGFND2_TYPE 20, 0.55-22 m) ----
# WIRING CHANGE REQUIRED: on AP it sat on SERIAL2 = TELEM2, which PX4 needs
# for the uXRCE-DDS link. Move the rangefinder to TELEM3, then:
SENS_TFMINI_CFG   103      # TELEM3 [VERIFY]: pick the port by NAME in the QGC
                           # dropdown, enum may differ per board
# No SER_TEL3_BAUD: the tfmini driver hardcodes B115200 (TFMINI.cpp:109) and
# declares no baudrate in module.yaml, so PX4 never creates that parameter for
# this port. AP ran the same 115200 (SERIAL2_BAUD 115), so the rate matches.
# EKF2_RNG_CTRL already set in gate3_ekf2.params (conditional aiding).
# CONFIRMED from the AP dump (not hypothetical): two downward rangefinders are
# configured. RNGFND1 = DroneCAN VL53L1X on the HereFlow, 0.08-0.65 m, at
# instance 1; RNGFND2 = this Benewake, 0.55-22 m. Both ORIENT 25 (down), and
# they overlap only over 0.55-0.65 m. PX4 instance ordering is NOT AP's.
# BLOCKING before Gate 3: `listener distance_sensor` must show which instance
# EKF2 consumes. If it is the VL53, height aiding saturates at 0.65 m —
# disable the VL53 publication on the HereFlow before any tethered hover.
